The trick with a rustproof Carrot is to throw it at a blinded Death.  He/she
will then hand you a blessed wand of nothing (177) which you then use to zap
your way into the secret BBQ pit on the 73rd level of Gehennom B.  If the wand
doesn't work, you obviously didn't sacrifice the rice golem on level 2.  Thus
you must eat 7 tins of organic werechicken (free-rangeonly!) on a lawful
altar.  At that point, you must dip your PC or whatever in Evian holy water
that's been cursed by a cancelled nalfeshnee.  If this all works out, you
should wake up the next moning with a horn in your forehead and a terrible
urge  to swim naked through the Pirates of the Carribean ride at Euro-Disney!



